    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1111">

                <pb facs="1146" n="1136" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg1136"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">393.115/9–2149: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Consul at
                        Shanghai</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">McConaughy</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-09-21T15:00:00-04:00">September 21,
                            1949—3 p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1940. Urgently request full report all facts bearing on allegations made by
                    Chinese Foreign Office stated Cantel 1134, Sep 21 to Dept, rptd Shanghai 542.
                    Include all pertinent entries both vessels logs and other info which masters can
                    supply. Make available immed and without comment to Isbrandtsen’s reps Hong Kong
                    and Shanghai statements made by Chen reftel. Action latter Hong Kong and
                    Shanghai respectively.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Webb</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
